{"id":10,"titleZh":"过去、现在与未来的奇特乐器","titleEn":"Unusual Instruments of the Past, Present, and Future","date":"1960-03-27","dateZh":"1960 年 3 月 27 日","concepts":"非常规奏法、古乐器谱系、电子与磁带音乐","thesis":"乐器奇特与否全看时代——五百年前常用的肖姆管今天进了博物馆，而眼下稀罕的电子与磁带声响正走向未来的常规音乐会。","plain":"常规乐器靠特定技巧就能发出非同寻常的声响；了解音乐史不只是背朝代，更是亲自去听古人当年常用的粗糙而浓烈的音色；而借助录音磁带倒放、变速与电子振荡器，现代音乐突破了传统发声物理材质的限制。","scenes":["演完维拉-洛博斯《小巴西地方火车》，不仅逐一展示巴西土著敲击乐器，还拆解弦乐滑音、长笛花舌与低音钢琴怎样合力造出火车汽笛与车轮声。","请出纽约古乐团与现代乐队在巴赫《第四勃兰登堡协奏曲》里一前一后对比奏响（古竖笛/古提琴/羽管键琴 vs. 现代长笛/小提琴/钢琴）；下半场现场演示磁带机《协奏曲》以及用铁皮卡祖笛独奏的新作。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1CT4y177rf","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CT4y177rf","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 过去、现在和未来的罕见乐器","duration":"52:51","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/unusual-instruments-of-the-past-present-and-future","repertoire":[{"composer":"Villa-Lobos","piece":"Bachianas Brasileiras No. 2 (The Little Train of the Caipira)","titleZh":"凯皮拉的小火车","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Villa-Lobos%20Bachianas%20Brasileiras%20No.%202+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Villa-Lobos%20Bachianas%20Brasileiras%20No.%202"},{"composer":"Francisco de la Torre","piece":"Alta (Danza)","titleZh":"古西班牙舞曲（肖姆管）","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Francisco%20de%20la%20Torre%20Alta+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Francisco%20de%20la%20Torre%20Alta"},{"composer":"Giovanni Gabrieli","piece":"Canzon septimi toni","titleZh":"八声部坎佐纳","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/ac/e4/a7/ace4a7f5-a380-4977-9a95-1c411176c263/mzaf_10213766693152543630.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/canzon-septimi-